### =========================
### PROFILE and friends
### =========================

### PROFILE - Atualizar usuário
PUT http://localhost:3333/profile HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Cookie: refreshToken={{refreshToken}}; auth:accessToken={{accessToken}}

{
    "name": "",
    "displayName": "",
    "bio": ""
}

### USERS - Buscar usuário por displayName
GET http://localhost:3333/user/rogerio HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json


### FRIENDS list all friends
GET http://localhost:3333/friends HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Cookie: refreshToken={{refreshToken}}; auth:accessToken={{accessToken}}



### FRIENDS list request friend
GET http://localhost:3333/request-friend HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Cookie: refreshToken={{refreshToken}}; auth:accessToken={{accessToken}}


